[node name="HUD" type="CanvasLayer" parent="."]

; Landscape layout, following the supplied mockup. Anchors only — no fixed
; screen sizes — so the same tree works on a 2400x1080 phone and a tablet.
;
; Panels live on the EDGES and the battlefield keeps the middle. On a phone
; that also keeps both thumbs off the part of the screen being looked at.

